    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busido Kensei The Last Warrior is a Rogue-Like action RPG with a twist. With Melee Combat you try and survive the demon hordes trying to take over the world. As the last warrior left it is up to you to protect the last remaining bastion of hope! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee Combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most Roguelike games we have a full on Melee combat system! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee: Using your katana slice through your enemies with a Light Attack or a Heavy Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash Attack: Dash into battle with a Dash Attack and slice through them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Roll: Roll out of harms way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every level gained select either a active or a passive skill to make you strong and let you fight for longer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and Equip Better Gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Rare or even Legendary gear while you fight of the hordes or destroy those evil bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight strong bosses that will drop gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Your Stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you still struggle to stay alive, use the upgrade stats menu and make your warrior stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For The Future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more Heroes, Skills, Enemies, Maps and Modes to come in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busido Kensei The Last Warrior is a Rogue-Like action RPG with a twist. With Melee Combat you try and survive the demon hordes trying to take over the world. As the last warrior left it is up to you to protect the last remaining bastion of hope! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee Combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most Roguelike games we have a full on Melee combat system! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee: Using your katana slice through your enemies with a Light Attack or a Heavy Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash Attack: Dash into battle with a Dash Attack and slice through them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Roll: Roll out of harms way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every level gained select either a active or a passive skill to make you strong and let you fight for longer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and Equip Better Gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Rare or even Legendary gear while you fight of the hordes or destroy those evil bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight strong bosses that will drop gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Your Stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you still struggle to stay alive, use the upgrade stats menu and make your warrior stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For The Future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more Heroes, Skills, Enemies, Maps and Modes to come in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
